00:26:47,340 --> 00:26:51,520
This place could collapse and kill
the Brats. Oops. You're right.

520
00:26:51,720 --> 00:26:53,014
That wouldn't be cool.

521
00:26:55,140 --> 00:26:55,970
Brownbeard!

522
00:26:56,053 --> 00:26:57,606
But they're on the same side!

523
00:26:57,820 --> 00:26:59,840
It looks like we've got company.

524
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,395
Their captain's back.

525
00:27:02,380 --> 00:27:04,360
Let's take care of them first.

526
00:27:09,820 --> 00:27:10,660
Oh, crap.

527
00:27:10,980 --> 00:27:13,980
Those guys are scary!
Are they giants? Mama.

528
00:27:14,260 --> 00:27:15,577
Not any kind I've seen.

529
00:27:15,660 --> 00:27:19,366
I'm warning you jerks, you better
not have hurt any of my crew!

530
00:27:32,580 --> 00:27:34,180
What the? Where'd he go?

531
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:50,940
Help me!

532
00:27:52,580 --> 00:27:54,260
They captured Nami!

533
00:27:54,500 --> 00:27:56,559
Those big jerks took her with them!

534
00:28:05,800 --> 00:28:08,617
The master said he wants this one alive.

535
00:28:08,700 --> 00:28:11,437
Right, the robot would vega punk's lasers!

536
00:28:11,520 --> 00:28:14,697
But we can kill the rest
of them in that case.

537
00:28:14,780 --> 00:28:16,977
Let's take our time and enjoy this hunt!

538
00:28:17,060 --> 00:28:18,860
Sounds cool to me.

539
00:28:31,600 --> 00:28:32,430
It's law.

540
00:28:32,513 --> 00:28:34,362
Where do you think you're going?

541
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:38,737
You can't leave right now.

542
00:28:38,820 --> 00:28:41,700
Not when the Navy's in the area room.

543
00:29:05,660 --> 00:29:07,100
I don't give a damn.

544
00:29:08,620 --> 00:29:13,200
You guys may not know this,
but I'd go where I want.
